{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-p006a","title":"董卓上表斥黄门述军士欲先诛宦官求资","accounts":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-p006a-account","label":"《典略》","text":"董卓上表斥黄门述军士欲先诛宦官求资","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p006a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0053","role":"上表","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p006a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"董卓奉召入京时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p006a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"dongyuan-e-p006a-q","source_order":[6,46,"P006a"],"order":1491}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0053","name":"董卓","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-p006a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-fdda259b43db663c5901","layer":"pei","quote":"《典略》载卓表曰：“臣伏惟天下所以有逆不止者，各由黄门、常侍张让等侮慢天常，操擅王命。父子兄弟，并据州郡；一书出门，便获千金。京畿诸郡，数百万膏腴美田，皆属让等。至使怨气上蒸，妖贼蜂起。臣前奉诏讨于扶罗，将士饥乏，不肯渡河。皆言欲诣京师先诛阉竖，以除民害，从台阁求乞资直；臣随慰抚，以至新安。臣闻扬汤止沸，不如灭火去薪；溃痈虽痛，胜于养肉；及溺呼船，悔之无及！”","attribution":"《典略》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3ae437330a1ff92c0f47","start":0,"end":181,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
